    {
      "subId": "2503201",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250320101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250320101": {
            "id": "250320101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Hmm... To evoke poetry with painting, or to paint with poeticism...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320102"
            ]
          },
          "250320102": {
            "id": "250320102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Hmm... No, no, aren't these two phrases referring to the same thing...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320105"
            ]
          },
          "250320105": {
            "id": "250320105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Ah, hello. That's right. I'm attempting to write a poem about Natlan's scenery.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320106"
            ]
          },
          "250320106": {
            "id": "250320106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "But... To be honest, the landscapes here are very different from those of Liyue. I'm not familiar with the local history, either, so I don't even know where to begin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320107"
            ]
          },
          "250320107": {
            "id": "250320107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Besides, I'm no professional poet, no rhymer of repute... Indeed, I've never even lived it up with a limerick...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320108"
            ]
          },
          "250320108": {
            "id": "250320108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "*sigh* But I can't simply go back empty-handed. My colleagues at the Ministry of Civil Affairs will tease me. \"Were you seeking inspiration out there, or just respiration?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320109"
            ]
          },
          "250320109": {
            "id": "250320109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You work at the Ministry?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320110"
            ]
          },
          "250320110": {
            "id": "250320110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "That I do... sort of. I was hired some time back to do some land surveys.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320111"
            ]
          },
          "250320111": {
            "id": "250320111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "*sigh* In practice, I was taking people around Liyue to see if the water and soil have changed, or if the maps need to be updated, and such.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320112"
            ]
          },
          "250320112": {
            "id": "250320112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "One round of that left me exhausted, and with goodness knows how many pairs of worn-out shoes... So I decided to take a vacation. Needed a change of pace, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320113"
            ]
          },
          "250320113": {
            "id": "250320113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "It's just that... I don't know what I was thinking, but when I applied for the time off, I gave my reason as: \"Got the urge to write some poetry. Going to get some inspiration.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250320114"
            ]
          },
          "250320114": {
            "id": "250320114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "I didn't expect the person in charge of approving leaves of absence to respond so seriously, with a \"May poetic puissance be yours\"... and half a month's leave to go with it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503211",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250321101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250321101": {
            "id": "250321101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "I've heard that there's a beautiful stage over where the Children of Echoes are, at which people perform daily.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250321102"
            ]
          },
          "250321102": {
            "id": "250321102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Please, help me take a picture of that grand stage at noon — better still if you could get a shot with those performing in it as well..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503212",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250321201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250321201": {
            "id": "250321201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "The Courier's Longhouse over where the Scions of the Canopy dwell sees much hustle and bustle, and the signboard of that famous spot, too, is most distinctive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250321202"
            ]
          },
          "250321202": {
            "id": "250321202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Hehe, could I ask you to snap a shot of it at sunset, thereabouts?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503220",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250322001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250322001": {
            "id": "250322001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Other than Djembe Studios, the People of the Springs play host to two other famous stores.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250322002"
            ]
          },
          "250322002": {
            "id": "250322002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "I'd love to compare their signboards, should they prove quite idiosyncratic as well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503221",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250322101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250322101": {
            "id": "250322101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Apart from the grand stage, word is that the Children of Echoes is also home to a large gemstone shop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250322102"
            ]
          },
          "250322102": {
            "id": "250322102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "A picture of those gems would make for a fine memento, I'd say..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503222",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250322201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250322201": {
            "id": "250322201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Hmm... There's a huge mural at the cliffs where the Scions of the Canopy live, isn't there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250322202"
            ]
          },
          "250322202": {
            "id": "250322202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zicheng",
            "text": "Now, if you find that mural, help me take a picture of it, would you?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}